--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Modern Web Guidance
  https://github.com/GoogleChrome/modern-web-guidance
  https://developer.chrome.com/docs/modern-web-guidance
  Stewarded by the Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Mozilla Firefox and MDN
  teams, alongside the web development community.

  - Software code: Apache License 2.0
  - Guide content under `guides/`: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    International (CC-BY 4.0)

  Portions of the upstream documentation are derived from MDN Web Docs by
