This repository does not vendor the corpus. `modern-web-guidance` is declared as
a normal npm dependency and installed from the public npm registry, so the guide
content stays under the upstream license and is updated by upgrading that
dependency.

`skill/modern-web-guidance/SKILL.md` is an adapted copy of the upstream skill
(`skills/modern-web-guidance/SKILL.md`), modified for DeepSeek Harness
conventions: Windows CLI invocation, an offline CLI path, model-facing tool
names for the `mwg_*` tools, and a condensed Chinese-language workflow. The
adapted text remains subject to the upstream licenses above.

